        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Life’s too calm? Time to break the rules!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Run from the Cops!</strong> puts you behind the wheel in a high-speed chase for freedom and fortune. Take control of a clever troublemaker determined to score quick money and make a clean getaway through chaotic city streets.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every escape is a test of reflexes and strategy — drift through corners, dodge roadblocks, and outsmart the police in <strong>fast-paced, arcade-style chases</strong>. You’ll need to find shortcuts, avoid collisions, and manage your timing perfectly to stay ahead of the law. The more you steal and the longer you survive, the bigger your reward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your mission:</strong><br>Pull off daring robberies, jump into your getaway car, and <strong>escape relentless police pursuit</strong> across multiple environments. Drive smart, stay cool under pressure, and prove that no cop can catch you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, unlock faster cars, tougher motorcycles, and new routes packed with hazards and surprises. Each level brings fresh challenges and smarter opponents, keeping every chase unpredictable and intense.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏁 <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌆 <strong>3 unique chase environments:</strong> Parking Run, City Run &amp; Winter Run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🚗 <strong>7 unlockable vehicles</strong> — 5 cars and 2 motorcycles with distinct handling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💵 <strong>Rob, escape, and upgrade</strong> — the faster you are, the richer you get</p></li></ul>",
